graph TD
    UserApp[用户脚本: offline_inference.py] --> Entrypoints[entrypoints/llm.py: LLM 入口类]
    
    subgraph Python 控制面
        Entrypoints --> Engine[engine/llm_engine.py: 调度协调器]
        Engine --> Worker[worker/worker.py: 单卡工作进程]
        Worker --> ModelRunner[worker/model_runner.py: 模型执行封装]
    end

    subgraph C++ 调度执行核 csrc/engine/
        Engine -.pybind11.-> CPPSched[csrc 调度器: Scheduler / BlockManager / Sequence]
        Worker -.pybind11.-> ZOS_CPP[csrc/engine/zos.cpp: 异步流水线控制]
    end

    subgraph 神经网络模型层 model_executor/
        ModelRunner --> DeepseekModel[models/deepseek.py: 主模型骨架]
        DeepseekModel --> DecoderLayer[models/decoder_layer.py: 40层迭代]
        DecoderLayer --> V4Attn[v4_modules/attn.py: MLA与SWA注意力]
        DecoderLayer --> V4MoE[v4_modules/mlp.py: 384专家并行前向]
        DecoderLayer --> DFlashModule[models/mtp/dflash.py: 草稿预测模块]
    end

    subgraph 底层算子与硬件分发 tilelang_ops/ & vendor/
        V4Attn --> TileRoot[tilelang_ops/: 平台动态重定向]
        V4MoE --> DeepEP[vendor/DeepEP: 跨卡专家通信]
        V4MoE --> DeepGEMM[vendor/DeepGEMM: FP8 矩阵乘]
        V4Attn --> FlashMLA[vendor/FlashMLA: MLA 解码内核]
        TileRoot --> CUDABackend[tilelang_ops/cuda/: 英伟达算子]
        TileRoot --> ASCBackend[tilelang_ops/asc/: 昇腾950算子]
    end
